      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"MongoId.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoId</code></a> represents a MongoDB specific <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/annotation/Id.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.annotation\"><code>Id</code></a> annotation that allows customizing id conversion.\nId properties use <a href=\"FieldType.html#IMPLICIT\"><code>FieldType.IMPLICIT</code></a> as the default\nid's target type. This means that the actual property value is used. No conversion attempts to any other\ntype are made. <br/>\nIn contrast to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/annotation/Id.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.annotation\"><code>@Id</code></a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> id's are stored as the such even when the actual value\nrepresents a valid <code>ObjectId hex String</code>. To trigger <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> to\n<code>ObjectId</code> conversion use <a href=\"#targetType()\"><code>@MongoId(FieldType.OBJECT_ID)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"MongoId.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping 中的注解接口\"><code>MongoId</code></a> 表示一种针对 MongoDB 的特定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/annotation/Id.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.annotation 中的类或接口\"><code>Id</code></a> 注解，允许自定义 ID 转换。\nID 属性默认使用 <a href=\"FieldType.html#IMPLICIT\"><code>FieldType.IMPLICIT</code></a> 作为目标类型。这意味着将直接使用实际的属性值，不会尝试将其转换为其他类型。<br/>\n与 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/annotation/Id.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.annotation 中的类或接口\"><code>@Id</code></a> 不同，<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>String</code></a> 类型的 ID 即使其实际值代表有效的 <code>ObjectId hex String</code>，也会以字符串形式存储。若要触发从 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>String</code></a> 到 <code>ObjectId</code> 的转换，请使用 <a href=\"#targetType()\"><code>@MongoId(FieldType.OBJECT_ID)</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Get the preferred _id type to be used. Defaults to <a href=\"FieldType.html#IMPLICIT\"><code>FieldType.IMPLICIT</code></a> which uses the property's\ntype. If defined different, the given value is attempted to be converted into the desired target type via\n<a href=\"../convert/MongoConverter.html#convertId(java.lang.Object,java.lang.Class)\"><code>MongoConverter.convertId(Object, Class)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "获取首选的 `_id` 类型。默认值为 <a href=\"FieldType.html#IMPLICIT\"><code>FieldType.IMPLICIT</code></a>，该值会使用属性的类型。如果定义不同，则尝试通过 <a href=\"../convert/MongoConverter.html#convertId(java.lang.Object,java.lang.Class)\"><code>MongoConverter.convertId(Object, Class)</code></a> 将给定值转换为所需的目标类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Get the preferred _id type to be used.",
      "translation": "获取首选的_id 类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the preferred id type. <a href=\"FieldType.html#IMPLICIT\"><code>FieldType.IMPLICIT</code></a> by default.",
      "translation": "首选的 ID 类型。默认为<a href=\"FieldType.html#IMPLICIT\"><code>FieldType.IMPLICIT</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Christoph Strobl, Mark Paluch",
      "translation": "克里斯托夫·施特罗布，马克·帕卢赫",
      "count": 1
    },
